1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,177
When you fast, glucose falls, and alpha cells release glucagon, which breaks glycogen down and puts glucose back.

2
00:00:08,177 --> 00:00:13,880
Glucagon, adrenaline, cortisol and growth hormone can all raise blood sugar.

3
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:15,585
Only insulin lowers it.

